==Russian==
{{wp|ru:}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ru|колѣя́||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*kʷelh₁-}}
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*kolěja}}. Related to {{m|sla-pro|*kolo}}. Cognate with {{cog|bg|коловоз}}, {{cog|cs|kolej}}, {{cog|pl|koleina}}, {{cog|sh|колотраг}}.

Compare typologically {{m+|gl|rodeira}}, {{m|gl|rodal}}, {{m|gl|rodada}}, {{m|gl|rilleira}}, {{m+|es|rodera}} (<… {{m+|la|rota}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|колея́}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-колея.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|колея́|adj=коле́йный}}

# {{lb|ru|automotive}} [[rut]] {{qualifier|mark of wheels on the ground}}
# {{lb|ru|railroads}} [[gauge]] {{qualifier|the distance between the rails of a line of railway track}}

